# LocalAI ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** local multi-backend engine/orchestrator with an OpenAI-compatible API.

**LEONES status:** P1 architectural; direct ODS integration not initially required.

## Summary

LocalAI supports many inference backends and hardware acceleration paths behind a common local API.

## ODS fit

Its strongest relevance is architectural: it demonstrates the value of a runtime registry and a stable API independent of the concrete inference engine.

ODS should learn from this pattern without making LocalAI a mandatory dependency.